{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o012a","title":"诏公卿近臣举良将","accounts":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o012a-account","label":"《明帝纪》正文","text":"诏公卿近臣举良将","evidence":["mingdi-e-o012a-q"]}],"participants":[],"place":null,"time":{"year":228,"label":"冬十月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"mingdi-y228","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"mingdi-q-o008","basis":"冬十月"},"evidence":["mingdi-e-o012a-q","mingdi-q-o008","mingdi-q-b-76fba510250937628a99"]},"ordering_evidence":"mingdi-e-o012a-q","source_order":[3,59,"O012a"],"order":748}],"persons":[],"evidence":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o012a-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-c12480a98111a703af26","layer":"original","quote":"冬十月，诏公卿近臣举良将〖21〗，各一人。十一月，司徒王朗薨。十二月，诸葛亮围陈仓；曹真遣将军费曜等拒之。﹝五﹞辽东太守公孙恭兄子渊，劫夺恭位；遂以渊领辽东太守。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":58,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":81},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-76fba510250937628a99","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-76fba510250937628a99","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：太和二年（公元 228）。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":60,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-38a74578b09178cb1fd4","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"mingdi-q-o008","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-bec9198de0001b0aa26c","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖1〗，宣王攻破新城。斩达，传其首〖2〗。﹝一﹞分新城之上庸、武陵、巫县为上庸郡〖3〗，锡县为锡郡。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":54,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":55}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
